{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"非分歧概形态射"},0],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“非分歧概形态射”"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>称"},{"Local":{"url":"概形","text":"概形"}},{"Plain":"态射 $f\\colon X\\to Y$ 非分歧 (unramified) 是指</p>\n<ul>\n<li>它是"},{"Local":{"url":"有限型概形态射","text":"有限型概形态射"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>对每个点 $x\\in X$, $\\mathcal O_{Y,f(x)}\\to\\mathcal O_{X,x}$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"非分歧的局部环同态","text":"非分歧的局部环同态"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>可分多项式</h3>\n<p>设 $A$ 为环, $B=A[t]/(F)$, $F$ 为首一多项式. 那么 $\\operatorname{Spec}(B)\\to\\operatorname{Spec}(A)$ 非分歧当且仅当 $F$ 可分, 即 $(F,F')$ 等于 $A[t]$ 的单位理想.</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"平展概形态射","text":"平展概形态射"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}